## Backups for rollback (if any fix looks wrong)

Every modified figure has a `.preimprove.bak` (P0 fixes) or `.preimprove2.bak` (P1 fixes) in `deck_assets/_originals/`. To roll one back:
```
mv deck_assets/_originals/<name>.png.preimprove.bak deck_assets/<name>.png
```
Source-script backups (for re-runnable fixes) are at `deck_assets/_originals/<name>.png.preimprove2_src.bak`.

Total: 13 backup files preserved.

